            "accordion_1_title": "Ingredients",
            "accordion_1_content": "<div class=\"ww-ing\">\n<div class=\"ww-ing-dot\"></div>\n<div>\n<h4>Organic Ginger Root Extract <span class=\"amt\">550 mg</span>\n</h4>\n<p>Standardized to contain 5% gingerols to deliver a consistent amount in every serving. Ginger has traditionally been used to support digestive comfort and maintain healthy gut motility*</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"ww-ing\">\n<div class=\"ww-ing-dot\"></div>\n<div>\n<h4>Rice Hulls</h4>\n<p>Ground rice hulls from whole rice grain are used as a natural flow agent in the manufacturing process to support consistent dosing in every capsule.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"ww-ing\">\n<div class=\"ww-ing-dot\"></div>\n<div>\n<h4>Rice Extract Blend</h4>\n<p>A blend of rice extract, rice hulls, gum arabic, and sunflower oil that helps the capsules fill smoothly, so your serving is consistent every time.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"ww-ing\">\n<div class=\"ww-ing-dot\"></div>\n<div>\n<h4>Hypromellose Capsule</h4>\n<p>Vegetarian capsule made from plant-derived cellulose, with no gelatin or animal products.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
